  "question": {
    "text": "The enolic form of given compound contains <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mover><mrow><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo></mrow></mover></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mover><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math>  <br/>x, <math><mi>σ</mi></math> bonds, y, <math></math> bonds, z lone pairs. The sum value of (x + y + z) is",
