  "correctValue": "15",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/6998fd57-5483-4c4c-9450-a0ca2c37385c.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:3.15in;height:0.775in\"> <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>12</mtext><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>  <br/>So x = 12, y = 1, z = 2 <br/>So x + y + z <br/>= 12 + 1 + 2 = 15",
